# Checklists

Release and per-feature gates only; detailed standards live in owner files in [`index.mdc`](./index.mdc).

## Release readiness

- [ ] Structure, layer boundaries, and dependencies match their owner rules.
- [ ] Theme/tokens, components, and layouts follow [`design-system.mdc`](./design-system.mdc), [`components.mdc`](./components.mdc), [`layouts.mdc`](./layouts.mdc).
- [ ] No hard-coded user-facing strings or `_FeatureText` copy classes.
- [ ] Layouts adapt across mobile, tablet, desktop; no hard-coded colors, spacing, or typography.
- [ ] Reusable widgets live in `frontend/lib/shared/`; catalog checked first.
- [ ] Auth/permissions align with backend entitlements; menus/routes/actions hidden for unauthorized users (RBAC+ABAC).
- [ ] UI/API use `human_friendly_id` only ([`data_modeling.mdc`](./data_modeling.mdc)).
- [ ] Subscription ∩ role permission intersection enforced ([`permissions.mdc`](./permissions.mdc)).
- [ ] API integration per [`.cursor/api-contract.mdc`](../../.cursor/api-contract.mdc).
- [ ] `flutter analyze` and `flutter test` pass ([`ci_cd_quality_gates.mdc`](./ci_cd_quality_gates.mdc)).

## Per-feature gate

- [ ] Standard `data/domain/presentation` structure; shared components reused.
- [ ] Queue screens follow [`ui-workspace.mdc`](./ui-workspace.mdc); feedback per [`ui-feedback.mdc`](./ui-feedback.mdc).
- [ ] No raw UUIDs, enum codes, or magic constants in presentation.
- [ ] Shared-data mutations follow [`instant_ui_sync.mdc`](./instant_ui_sync.mdc); cancel/failure never patches or refreshes.
- [ ] Tests cover controller logic and critical UI.

